Why This Is Asked
Tests cross-region disaster recovery planning at scale, including SAP replication, AWS DR primitives, and governance. Requires concrete IaC and a runbook-oriented workflow.

Key Concepts
- SAP HANA System Replication (HSR)
- AWS DR primitives: S3 backups, cross-region EBS snapshots, Route 53 failover
- IAM SCP governance across accounts; temporary credentials for DR
- Step Functions orchestration; minimal CDK/CloudFormation snippets

Code Example
```javascript
// Minimal CDK-like snippet: DR role and Step Functions skeleton
